# Session start

At the beginning of a new session, before writing code or making changes:

1. Read `docs/STATUS.md` — current phase, completed work, in progress, blockers
2. Skim `docs/project-roadmap.md` only when the task needs roadmap detail (stack, phase steps, conventions)

Briefly confirm:

- Current phase and last completed item
- What is in progress
- Anything blocked

Do not start implementation until `docs/STATUS.md` has been read.

If `docs/STATUS.md` is missing or clearly stale, ask the user to confirm state before proceeding.

For `docs/history/` format and file map, see `documentation.mdc` when documenting completed work.
